#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:14 f9b0f03d6e394ffdbd9360d4642bad08
msgid "Performs real-time frequency spectrum analysis on audio signals for visualization and analysis."
msgstr "频谱分析器，可读取频段幅度、RMS 和频谱重心。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:19 94dec664bc2d4138af2927b3d29729fa
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:21 acb8e3358d394bc9836e432c2eaa7490
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer analyzes the frequency content of audio passing through an audio "
"bus in real-time using Fast Fourier Transform (FFT). This is essential for creating audio "
"visualizations such as spectrum analyzers, equalizer displays, or reactive audio effects."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer**    会在总线效果链中插入 FFT "
"DSP，并从中读取频谱数据。它不会主动改变声音，主要用于可视化、节拍/能量检测、频段驱动的 UI 或调试混音。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:23 628347b087964503b878eb91eab29ea1
msgid ""
"The effect processes incoming audio and provides frequency magnitude data that can be queried "
"using "
":ref:`get_magnitude_for_frequency_range()<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_method_get_magnitude_for_frequency_range>`."
" You can analyze specific frequency ranges (e.g., bass, midrange, treble) independently."
msgstr ""
"处理输入音频并提供频率幅度数据，可通过    "
":ref:`get_magnitude_for_frequency_range()<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_method_get_magnitude_for_frequency_range>`"
"    分别查询低频、中频、高频等频段。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:25 67937cd587644f08aecbbca4f7dbe37b
msgid ""
"Queries reuse a spectrum snapshot while the bus DSP clock is unchanged. The next audio block "
"automatically refreshes the snapshot, including when manually mixing multiple blocks in one game "
"frame. Changing :ref:`fft_size<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_property_fft_size>` or "
"attaching the effect to another bus invalidates the snapshot."
msgstr ""
"总线 DSP 时钟未变化时，查询会复用频谱快照。下一个音频块会刷新快照，同一游戏帧中手动混音多个音频块时也会更新。修改    "
":ref:`fft_size<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_property_fft_size>`    或将效果器挂载到其他总线会使快照失效。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:27 8605184c7e754a5cb3a68c5c8d960341
msgid ""
"The :ref:`fft_size<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_property_fft_size>` determines the "
"analysis window and frequency resolution. Larger FFT sizes provide finer frequency detail at the "
"cost of time resolution and processing work. "
":ref:`buffer_length<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_property_buffer_length>` is currently "
"stored for compatibility and does not change the FFT window or retain audio history."
msgstr ""
":ref:`fft_size<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_property_fft_size>`  决定分析窗口和频率分辨率。FFT "
"越大，频率细节越精确，但时间分辨率更低、处理开销更大。 "
":ref:`buffer_length<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_property_buffer_length>`  "
"当前仅为兼容而保存，不会改变 FFT 窗口，也不会保留音频历史。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:29 1ee6c9e77c1444a799db47dcac513038
msgid ""
"When configured in a :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` slot, obtain its runtime"
" instance with "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` and "
"query that instance. Shared configuration resources create independent analysis state for each "
"slot."
msgstr ""
"配置在 :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` 槽位中时，通过 "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` "
"获取运行实例并查询该实例。共享配置资源的槽位各自拥有独立分析状态。"

