#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:222 958763d8781a4f7bbd833c7214f80430
msgid ""
"The FFT (Fast Fourier Transform) size used for spectrum analysis. Larger FFT sizes provide better"
" frequency resolution (more frequency bins) but worse time resolution and higher CPU usage. See "
":ref:`FFTSize<enum_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_FFTSize>` for available options. The default "
":ref:`FFT_SIZE_1024<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_constant_FFT_SIZE_1024>` provides a "
"good balance for general visualization."
msgstr ""
"FFT 窗口大小 （参见   :ref:`FFTSize<enum_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_FFTSize>`  ） （参见   "
":ref:`FFT_SIZE_1024<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_constant_FFT_SIZE_1024>`  ）"

